1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,71,39,41,55,40],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"98","reputation":"3450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1008205","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1046","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,71,39,41,55,40],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1008205","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10011","city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,71,39,41,55,40],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1008205","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国武将，刘备执意攻吴时担任刘备的副将。宜都与张南、吴班等人夜袭孙桓，大获全胜。并后续进军中向刘备提出了树荫下驻营可以避暑的建议。但却被陆逊火烧连营，火中继续奋战，企图与张南冲出吴军包围，失败被杀。","tc":"蜀國武將，劉備執意攻吳時擔任劉備的副將。宜都與張南、吳班等人夜襲孫桓，大獲全勝。并后續進軍中向劉備提出了樹蔭下駐營可以避暑的建議。但卻被陸遜火燒連營，火中繼續奮戰，企圖與張南沖出吳軍包圍，失敗被殺。","en":"An officer of Shu, serving as Liu Bei's deputy when Liu Bei insisted on attacking Wu. At Yidu, he joined Zhang Nan, Wu Ban, and others in a night raid on Sun Huan that achieved a great victory. During the subsequent advance, he suggested to Liu Bei that they make camp beneath the shade of trees to escape the summer heat. However, Lu Xun launched a fire attack on the connected camps. He continued fighting amid the flames, attempting to break through the Wu encirclement with Zhang Nan, but they failed and he was killed.","jp":"蜀の武将。劉備が呉への侵攻を強行した際、劉備の副将を務めた。宜都にて張南や呉班らと共に孫桓に夜襲を仕掛け、大勝を収める。その後の進軍中、木陰に宿営して暑さを避けるよう劉備に進言した。しかし陸遜に連営を火攻めされ、火中にあっても奮戦を続け、張南と共に呉軍の包囲を突破しようと試みるも討死した。","kr":"촉나라 무장으로, 유비가 오나라 정벌을 고집할 때 부장군을 맡았다. 이도에서 장남, 오반 등과 함께 손환을 야습하여 대승을 거두었다. 이후 진군하는 과정에서 유비에게 나무 그늘에 영채를 세워 더위를 피하자는 건의를 올렸다. 그러나 육손의 화공으로 연영이 불타 버렸고, 불길 속에서도 계속 분전하며 장남과 함께 오군의 포위를 뚫으려 했으나 실패하여 피살되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10399","remark":"","surname":"冯","surnameTc":"馮","surnameEn":"Feng","surnameJp":"馮","surnameKr":"풍","surnameOther":"","name":"习","nameTc":"習","nameEn":"Xi","nameJp":"習","nameKr":"습","nameOther":"","word":"休元","wordTc":"休元","wordEn":"Xiuyuan","wordJp":"休元","wordKr":"휴원","wordOther":"","icon":"冯习","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"201","city":"CS1046","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"71","wise":"39","politics":"41","charm":"55","will":"40","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"22/22/67/22/22/10/50/22","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012405","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5100","battleSoulPoint":"5000","debateSoulPoint":"1500","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"2/3/2/0/0/0/2/0/0/0/1/1/1/0/1/0/0/1/0/0/0/1/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"49","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"182","show":"201","death":"222","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1008205","helmet":"WP1023305","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;19/1;25/1;57/1;12/2;30/1;45/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"蜀国武将，刘备执意攻吴时担任刘备的副将。宜都与张南、吴班等人夜袭孙桓，大获全胜。并后续进军中向刘备提出了树荫下驻营可以避暑的建议。但却被陆逊火烧连营，火中继续奋战，企图与张南冲出吴军包围，失败被